{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every red book in the display, there is a corresponding arrangement of items: a pen lies directly below the book and is aligned vertically with it. To the right of the pen are scissors, and to the right of the scissors is a mouse. Situated below the pen is a blue shoe, which is also vertically aligned with the pen. Finally, the shoe is positioned to the left of a spoon.",
